abstract: >-
  An open research and learning resource on emerging issues in knowledge
  management, including artificial intelligence, generative AI, knowledge
  graphs, digital transformation, organizational learning, knowledge sharing,
  knowledge retention, provenance, information governance, cybersecurity, and
  organizational memory.
